}
{\plain {similar sequence S}{\fs16 \dn8 
k,k1}{ of (}{\ul \b 3.7}{). We carry along
 the illustration of a FIR of length M; 
its DTFT is easily computed using the sum
 of a finite geometric sequence and was 
given in Exercise 6.3.}}
}
.ATT
.STATUS Go to Section 3, p. 4
.GOTO 3_bk.mcd
.ATT_END
