{\plain {Because any IDTFT H1(}{\f1 w}{)
 has period 2}{\f1 p}{, H1(}{\f1 w}{-}{\f1 
w}{\fs16 \dn8 d}{) for any frequency translation
 }{\f1 w}{\fs16 \dn8 d}{ is well-defined
 and clearly }{\f1 w}{\fs16 \dn8 d}{ enters
 only as pod(}{\f1 w}{\fs16 \dn6 d}{,2}{\f1 
p}{). The next Property follows easily from
 the }{IDTFT}{ definition with a change 
of summing index. }}
}
