 the IDTFT of the translated DTFT H1(}{\f1 
w}{-}{\f1 w}{\fs16 \dn8 d}{) is \{exp(i}{\f1 
w}{\fs16 \dn8 d}{ n) h}{\dn8 n}{,       
       n=...,-1,0,1,...\}. }}
}
