{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
{\f2\fnil CG Times;}
}
{\plain {But we already have some insight
 into this problem as we now point out. 
Note that the DTFT of an M-length window
 is a rational function of exp(i}{\f1 w}{)
 with exactly M complex zeros: therefore,
 it is impossible to confine the DTFT to
 an interval within [0,2}{\f1 p}{].}}
}
