{\plain {This function is called the }{\b 
signum}{ function whose value is }{\f1 w}{/|}{\f1 
w}{| except at }{\f1 w}{=0 where it is taken
 as 0. Since this function is discontinuous,
 it cannot be the DTFT of an absolutely 
summable sequence. While the computation
 of the IDTFT is easily done- we know the
 integral of an exponential!- we use Mathcad's
 Symbolic mathematics capability. Choose
 }{\b Load Symbolic Processor}{ from the
 }{\b Symbolic}{ menu. Type in the form 
we wish to compute.}}
}
